      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Habitats",
          "lines": [
            "Organic debris in Adzerak’s ruined corridor"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Appearance",
          "lines": [
            "A one-inch grasshopper-like insect with gripping pincers at the rear of its abdomen."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Special attacks and weaknesses mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Swarm attack · Only the swarm attacks. The encounter lists one attack at THAC0 20. Each swarm hit deals 1d10 damage and drains 1 point of Constitution.",
            "Constitution loss · At Constitution 2 the victim falls unconscious. At 0 the victim dies. Lost Constitution returns at 1 point per day."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Encounters mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Ruined corridor · While characters search or handle the rubbish in area 12, there is a cumulative 10% chance per turn of an encounter. Each such encounter has an equal chance of being ten Rot Grubs or fifty Pernicons."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Table notes",
          "lines": [
            "50 appearing in this encounter. 1 HP and 15 XP per individual. Unreliable (4) morale. Nonintelligent (0). Neutral.",
            "John Terra, Four from Cormyr (TSR, 1997), The Bibliophile, area 12, p. 16."
          ]
        }
      ],
